        "<b>Reduce cancellations</b>: book the full plan of care at evaluation, explain expected visit count, verify benefits and cost, send reminders.",
        "<b>Productivity metrics</b>: visits/day, units/visit, % of paid time in billable care. Always pair with quality and outcome metrics.",
        "<b>PT only</b>: exam, evaluation, diagnosis, prognosis, plan of care, re-evaluation, discharge.",
        "<b>PTA</b>: interventions within the PT's plan; can adjust within the plan; supervision level set by state law and payer.",
        "<b>Aides</b>: non-skilled support tasks under direct on-site supervision; cannot deliver skilled, billable therapy.",
        "<b>Policy</b> = the rule and why. <b>Procedure</b> = the steps. Review yearly and after incidents.",
        "<b>System fix</b>: measure, find root cause, change the process, re-measure."
