        "<b>Days in A/R</b>: how long until payment. <b>Net collection rate</b> = collected / allowed. <b>Denial rate</b> = denied claims / submitted claims.",
        "<b>Fixed costs</b>: rent, salaries, software. <b>Variable costs</b>: supplies, per-visit pay, processing fees.",
        "<b>Contribution margin</b> = revenue per visit - variable cost per visit.",
        "<b>Break-even visits</b> = fixed costs / contribution margin.",
        "<b>Average revenue per visit</b> is a weighted average across the payer mix.",
        "<b>Cash-based</b>: no claims or denials, price must be justified by value; offer superbills; PTs cannot opt out of Medicare.",
        "<b>Budget variance</b> = actual - budget; review monthly and find the cause."
