        "<b>Ethical marketing</b>: truthful claims, no guaranteed outcomes, authorized testimonials, no PHI in review replies, no routine copay waivers.",
        "<b>Startup sequence</b>: plan and pro forma -> entity -> tax ID -> license/permits -> NPI -> insurance -> credentialing (months) -> space/EMR -> policies -> launch.",
        "<b>Metrics</b>: referral source per patient, cost to acquire a patient, patient lifetime value."
