        ["Which metric BEST shows which marketing channel brings patients who complete their care?", ["Plan of care completion by referral source", "Total website visits per month", "Number of social media followers", "Count of flyers handed out at events"], "Linking completion to referral source shows which channels bring committed patients; traffic numbers do not."],
        ["A new owner has limited capital and uncertain demand. Which launch approach is MOST prudent?", ["Rent space in a gym to test demand before a long lease", "Sign a 10-year lease to lock in a lower rent rate", "Buy all new equipment before booking any patients", "Hire three PTs before credentialing is complete"], "Starting lean tests demand and protects cash. Long commitments before proving demand increase risk."],
        ["Which item is an internal strength in a SWOT analysis for a PT-owned clinic?", ["The owner's advanced manual therapy training", "A growing retirement population nearby", "A new employer moving into the region", "A local payer cutting reimbursement"], "Strengths are internal attributes. Population, employers, and payer changes are external."],
        ["A PT offers a free injury prevention talk at a local shipyard. Which marketing channel is this?", ["Direct-to-employer community outreach", "Physician referral development", "Paid search engine advertising", "Payer network contracting"], "Employer talks are direct community outreach that builds a non-physician referral stream."]
